<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: LIST OF DIVIDENDS OF CZECH MAIN MARKET COMPANIES.</title>
<headline>LIST OF DIVIDENDS OF CZECH MAIN MARKET COMPANIES.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
